---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — LUMÉ" description="LUMÉ is a curated cosmetics collection built by a small team who test everything before it goes on the shelf.">
	<div class="container about-page">
		<div class="about-head">
			<p class="eyebrow">About LUMÉ</p>
			<h1>A collection, not a catalog.</h1>
		</div>

		<div class="about-body">
			<p class="lead">
				LUMÉ began as a simple idea: a beauty shop stocked only with things we'd genuinely
				recommend to a friend, not everything a supplier could ship us.
			</p>
			<p>
				We're a small team of people who spend an unreasonable amount of time reading
				ingredient lists, testing formulas on ourselves, and arguing about which serum
				actually earns its price. Every brand in the collection passed that filter before it
				ever reached the shop — no sponsored placements, no filler products to round out a
				category.
			</p>
			<p>
				That means the collection stays small on purpose. Forty pieces today, chosen across
				skincare, makeup, hair and fragrance, each one doing a specific job well rather than
				trying to be everything to everyone. We'd rather stock ten products we trust than a
				hundred we're indifferent to.
			</p>
			<p>
				Editor's Picks — the badge you'll see scattered through the shop — marks whatever our
				team is currently reaching for ourselves. It changes as we test new arrivals and
				re-evaluate old favourites, so it's less a permanent hall of fame and more a running
				, honest opinion.
			</p>
			<p class="note">
				A quick note for the curious: LUMÉ is a demo storefront template — a working example
				of the kind of e-shop we build for clients, shown here with a fictional brand and a
				sample product catalog.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about-page {
		padding-block: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px) clamp(90px, 10vw, 130px);
	}

	.about-head {
		max-width: 60ch;
		margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px);
	}

	.about-head h1 {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-weight: 400;
		font-size: clamp(32px, 4.6vw, 54px);
		margin: 10px 0 0;
	}

	.about-body {
		max-width: 640px;
	}

	.about-body .lead {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: clamp(19px, 2vw, 23px);
		line-height: 1.5;
		margin: 0 0 24px;
	}

	.about-body p {
		color: var(--color-ink-soft);
		line-height: 1.8;
		margin: 0 0 22px;
		font-size: 15.5px;
	}

	.about-body .note {
		margin-top: 36px;
		padding-top: 24px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
		font-size: 13px;
	}
</style>
